{"parentUuid":"15ba4847-49df-475a-9112-687287fbdcc6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQM5CSRB5HHi1sug9Eny","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":287899,"output_tokens":592,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":287899,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5125,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"9988692c-2484-4558-af91-0813a4be64ea","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChQM5CDmyr4BaJCs6x7YT","requestRef":"214031c7-5d30-4793-903f-e942fb6d7f99","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"bd3b43b2-03e4-4bd5-ac98-23a6ecb83396","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:21:19.530Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"hidden-dancing-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
{"parentUuid":"bd3b43b2-03e4-4bd5-ac98-23a6ecb83396","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQM5CSRB5HHi1sug9Eny","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's sent. The email went to all 18 paying JusPrin 1 subscribers at 1:20 PM PST, and SendGrid shows the campaign as sent. Before I sent it, I checked that the draft matched the approved text exactly, and that every one of the 18 had their own code. SendGrid's confirmation showed 18 recipients and the subject \"JusPrin 2 is out, and you keep your price\". I've added the 18 addresses to the record of who has been emailed, in the email data folder.\n\n**Decision needed: who stops each JusPrin 1 subscription once its owner moves?** The email promises that a mover's current subscription \"runs to the end of the time you've already paid for, then stops, so you never pay for both\". Nothing does that automatically. Someone has to run the `jusprin1_pending_moves` command and end each listed subscription on Obico's Chargebee site at the end of its term. Ending it immediately would refund the unused time. If a subscription renews first, that person is charged twice and needs a manual refund. The first monthly renewals are on 7 December, so this matters within two weeks.\n\n- **A daily task:** I set up a scheduled task that runs the command every day and tells you who moved. Ending the subscriptions on Chargebee would still be your click, because it changes billing. This costs you a minute a day only on days someone moves.\n- **You do it yourself:** You run the command whenever you like. This costs nothing to set up, but nothing reminds you.\n\nMy pick is the daily task, because forgetting it means double-charging someone.\n\nThe guessable live coupon `jusprin1-move-first-term` is also still open. Its id is easy to guess, and anyone who guesses it gets a free first Hobby period.\n\nShould a daily task check for movers, or will you run the check yourself?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":287899,"output_tokens":592,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":287899,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9988692c-2484-4558-af91-0813a4be64ea","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChQM5CDmyr4BaJCs6x7YT","requestRef":"214031c7-5d30-4793-903f-e942fb6d7f99","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b4c7c6b-0a3e-4992-b2be-547e561c6c33","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:21:19.541Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"hidden-dancing-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
