{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChQM9g7BAxZ48qemJSsTn","mark_sent_by":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","listed":["REDACTED"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"1e9291cd-5c75-4d27-ab16-74ac83f59602","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQM9g7BAxZ48qemJSsTn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've set up the daily check, and a first run is going now to make sure it works. I'll report its result when it finishes.\n\nWhat it does:\n\n- **When it runs:** every day at about 8:04 AM, starting tomorrow. It only runs while the Claude app is open. If the app is closed at 8 AM, it runs the next time the app opens.\n- **What it checks:** it runs `jusprin1_pending_moves` on production. That command lists every JusPrin 1 subscription whose owner now has a JusPrin 2 plan.\n- **It changes nothing.** You end each listed subscription yourself on Obico's Chargebee site, choosing \"at the end of the current term\". Each run reminds you never to cancel immediately, because that refunds the unused time.\n- **When you hear from it:** only when there's something to act on. Then it sends a push notification with subscription ids, not email addresses, and lists first anything renewing within 3 days, marked URGENT. It also flags:\n  - anyone whose address match isn't verified;\n  - anyone who bought a regular JusPrin 2 plan instead of the loyalty plan;\n  - loyalty plans it couldn't match to a JusPrin 1 subscription, which usually means a different sign-up address.\n  \n  On a day with nothing to act on, it stays quiet.\n- **If the check fails,** it notifies you with the exact error instead of guessing.\n- **Permission mode:** it was saved in Bypass permissions mode, because this session runs in it. That means its runs use tools without asking. You can change that by editing the task under Scheduled in the sidebar.\n\nThe guessable live coupon `jusprin1-move-first-term` is still open."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":296563,"output_tokens":543,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":325,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":543,"cache_read_input_tokens":296563,"cache_creation_input_tokens":325,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":325},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a4460bc1-1788-4d7c-bc47-d274c19e55b0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChQM9fsJTyWmjMneKzkyL","requestRef":"b2a13b02-084c-41f8-a4ec-812c94733b46","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"scheduled-tasks","attributionMcpTool":"run_scheduled_task","type":"assistant","uuid":"0264494f-3527-456d-8414-c65cc5d05566","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:22:20.098Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"hidden-dancing-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
