{"parentUuid":"0e85f4a9-9d5d-4dfe-8168-e4f5bb07d676","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQMEkTFyF3AcvMqwP8dY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That line means nobody has moved yet, so there's nothing for you to do today.\n\nHere's the summary line piece by piece:\n\n- **\"19 live JusPrin 1 subscriptions\"**: 19 people are still paying for JusPrin 1. That includes the one who has already cancelled, because their subscription runs until 8 August 2027.\n- **\"0 to end at the end of the term\"**: no JusPrin 1 subscriber has a JusPrin 2 plan yet, so there's no subscription for you to end. The email only went out about an hour before this check.\n- **\"0 already ending\"**: no one who moved had a JusPrin 1 subscription already set to stop.\n- **\"0 loyalty plans unmatched\"**: no one has used a code with an address the check couldn't match.\n\nIt behaved as designed: nothing to act on, so no notification. On a day someone moves, the \"to end\" count goes up, and you get a notification naming the subscription and its renewal date.\n\n**One subscriber didn't get the email.** It's 19 subscriptions but only 18 emails. The 19th person pays $6.99 a month, renews on 18 December, and already has a JusPrin 2 account with no plan. I left them out of the upload when the plan was to move everyone by hand, because they were meant to get their own version of the email after you moved them. The code plan replaced that, so right now they have no email and no code. There were only 18 codes, one per person emailed, so they'd need a new one from the monthly batch.\n\nShould I ask the loyalty session to make one more code, then send this person the same email?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":297531,"output_tokens":679,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":177},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1328,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":679,"cache_read_input_tokens":297531,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1328},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6a13d3a7-3d14-45b3-acd5-19a4597ae4cb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChQMEkBPaKCkD7GNgNeBB","requestRef":"66a3952c-09c1-4676-807e-025ac07ee597","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ffdb109-738c-4f4c-9604-31315bedd55b","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:23:30.257Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"hidden-dancing-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
