{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","hash":"eb1a87de4a70be4185d72092467184741ea7d6f4ae2042caef5709ec34366f55","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JUMGfcknkweF1ugDdrk6EF","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Get one more live code from the loyalty session","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Add the subscriber to SendGrid with their code","status":"pending"},{"content":"Copy the campaign to a one-person send","status":"pending"},{"content":"Send it and confirm","status":"pending"}],"scope":"continuation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AtUXgyACA7GsKHcqMEQCPH","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"local_c2b9f42b-4cb3-4805-978b-8b715d50a555","summary":"Ask loyalty session for a 19th live code","message":"Kenneth approved one more live loyalty code for a JusPrin 1 subscriber I missed. His words, replying to my question \"Get one more code made and send this subscriber the same email?\": \"Yes, fix it\".\nWhat happened: there are 19 paying JusPrin 1 subscribers, not 18. I left one out of the upload list when the plan was to move people by hand, and never added them back after the switch to codes. This person pays $6.99 a month, renews on 18 December, and already has a JusPrin 2 account with no plan. They are the one row in /Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data/jusprin1_subscribers_2026-11-24.csv that is not in jusprin1_subscribers_upload_2026-11-24.csv.\nPlease:\n1. Create one more code in the regular batch, jusprin1-loyalty-codes, on the live jusprinv2 Chargebee site.\n2. Append a row for this person to /Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data/jusprin1_codes_live.csv. Keep the file at mode 600.\n3. Check that the code is unused and in the right batch, then message me.\nPlease don't touch SendGrid. I'll send the email."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
