{"parentUuid":"0212f9eb-6b9c-4d50-ab03-41c6da43a513","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01BkjUSc17hDis9X7eqsiqyK","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6036b412-ccf9-4aab-827c-23bf65ef64e5","timestamp":"2026-11-25T21:31:36.178Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/jusprin2-email-data","sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"hidden-dancing-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
{"parentUuid":"6036b412-ccf9-4aab-827c-23bf65ef64e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQMro3HkZu46mhTurFFc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's fixed. The subscriber I missed got the same email at 1:30 PM PST with their own code, so all 19 of 19 paying JusPrin 1 subscribers have now been emailed. Nobody was left out this time.\n\n- **The code.** The loyalty session made one more live code. Chargebee reports it as unused and in the regular batch. The codes file now has 19 rows, with 19 different people and 19 different codes.\n- **SendGrid.** I put this person on a new one-person list with their code and \"month\", \"$6.99 a month\" and \"$10 a month\". I sent them a copy of the approved campaign. SendGrid's confirmation showed 1 recipient, and the API shows it as sent. A test copy to k@obico.io beforehand had the full text with every field filled in.\n- **The daily check covers them too.** It looks at all 19 JusPrin 1 subscriptions, so once this person uses their code, you'll be told to end their subscription before it renews on 18 December.\n\nThe guessable live coupon `jusprin1-move-first-term` is still open. Its id is easy to guess, and anyone who guesses it gets a free first Hobby period."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":339223,"output_tokens":375,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":839,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":375,"cache_read_input_tokens":339223,"cache_creation_input_tokens":839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":839},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"inpu