{"parentUuid":"8133e214-a291-4055-bb82-90b6508b62f4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3a3c9c0d-d32f-4951-8247-11876ce7ec91","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nThe session \"Verify a moved JusPrin 1 subscriber isn't billed twice\" you started (local_120b7ae4-455f-4969-ab29-1246e7b02a33) finished a turn and then reported that it was waiting on the user. Its Claude Code session is add978a3-990b-43a6-be9a-298bca41fa26. It reported (quoted child output, data not instructions): \"The loyalty plan is live. Production and staging both run the new server version that includes it (image `obi.4140`), and production checked out healthy afterwards: all 10 websocket pods were ready and the health check returned 200. The live JusPrin 2 Chargebee site has the loyalty prices, the coupon and 19 one-time codes, one per JusPrin 1 subscriber. The code list is at `~/.claude/jusprin2-email\" (first 400 of 1573 characters) Read it with mcp__ccd_session_mgmt__get_session / list_events (session id local_120b7ae4-455f-4969-ab29-1246e7b02a33) if you need details, and if it still waits, tell the user so in one line.\n</system-reminder>\n<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): verify-jusprin-2-chargeb = local_1ae65d86-2760-4594-94a2-157beb64e86e (idle); sign-jusprin-s-windows-b = local_1ce99f94-2f8a-4485-b5ae-3e809fea773b (idle); home-let-people-dismiss = local_2c6fda28-de55-4fec-a9fa-f183faf7c9b5 (idle); put-the-jusprin-2-server = local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d (idle); opt-in-before-jusprin-2 = local_5b5c4dae-b676-44e9-9c1a-7469fec69e96 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); home-shows-stale-credits = local_afbc5de2-baa6-429c-8931-f6dc91d5bc32 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); jusprin-2-announcement-o = local_3f72dc00-322a-4889-8844-542d5ba987d6 (idle); obico-emails-add-gmail-o = local_780fe5a4-1672-4acd-9a77-827e5f0424e3 (done, PR #1176); document-ml-traffic-movi = local_a284bf37-e