{"parentUuid":"7037ba83-3beb-485b-a010-ce4bc7d4b701","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3a3c9c0d-d32f-4951-8247-11876ce7ec91","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jaAZfY2oS3bf48RY4gmKX","type":"tool_result","content":"20:                                SendGrid stores opens/clicks on the contact, so they are lost when contacts are deleted.\n26:All 48,401 SendGrid contacts were deleted 2026-11-17 (\"Delete All Contacts\"); campaign totals and the\n46:                                Delete these contacts before 2026-12-01 (storage is billed on the month's peak).\n78:                                Still to do: delete them before 2026-12-01.\n91:                                fields filled correctly. Delete both when Kenneth agrees.\nREADME.txt\njusprin2_sent_all.csv\njusprin1_missed_upload.csv\njusprin1_codes_live.csv\njusprin1_subscriber_email.txt\njusprin1_subscriber_email.html\njusprin1_subscriber_email_handmove.txt\njusprin1_subscriber_email_handmove.html\njusprin1_codes_upload.csv\njusprin1_subscriber_email_draft.md\nfix_4199.csv\njusprin1_subscribers_upload_2026-11-24.csv\ntest_v1sub_fields.csv\njusprin1_subscribers_2026-11-24.csv\nbatch5_opens_clicks_2026-11-24.csv\nbatch5_arms_sent_2026-11-17.csv\nbatch5_email_b_nobeta.html\nbatch5_email_a_nobeta.html\nbatch5_email_b.html\nbatch5_email_a.html\nbatch5_email_b.txt\nbatch5_email_a.txt\nbatch5_email_b_nobeta.txt\nbatch5_email_a_nobeta.txt\nbatch5_candidates_4groups_2026-11-17.csv\nbatch5_upload_4groups.csv\nbatch5_upload.csv\nbatch5_candidates_2026-11-17.csv\ncampaign_daily_stats_2026-11-17.txt\nbatch4_opens_clicks_2026-11-17.csv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"929766a5-5461-4813-b3ee-b558ae85b58a","timestamp":"2026-11-25T23:56:05.333Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"20:                                SendGrid stores opens/clicks on the contact, so they are lost when contacts are deleted.\n26:All 48,401 SendGrid contacts were deleted 2026-11-17 (\"Delete All Contacts\"); campaign total