{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChQYu2VW4SrjapM3Cmkii","mark_sent_by":"c2adecd8-a1fc-4e82-9512-79ed47bbae43","listed":["msg_011ChQYtFXYgHRAhagkXikaK"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"7a03916f-326d-4cf2-a7d0-caffb1c1be49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQYu2VW4SrjapM3Cmkii","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. Besides the daily subscriber check, seven things are still open. One has a deadline, two are things you were already asked about, and the rest are cleanup.\n\n**Deadline: delete the batch 5 contacts before 1 December.** SendGrid still holds the 4,110 Obico users who got the batch 5 email. SendGrid bills for contact storage at the month's peak, so deleting them before 1 December saves a month. I already saved who opened and who clicked on 24 November, so deleting them loses nothing. I would delete only the batch 5 list. \"Delete All Contacts\" would also remove the 19 JusPrin 1 subscribers, and with them the open and click records for today's email.\n\n**Already asked, still waiting on you:**\n- **The guessable live coupon** `jusprin1-move-first-term`. Its id is easy to guess, and anyone who guesses it gets a free first Hobby period. Archiving it closes that.\n- **The test of whether batch 4 did better because of its audience or its email.** I proposed sending batch 4's text and batch 5's text, split at random, to about 9,350 Obico users last active 30–270 days ago. You haven't said whether to build it.\n\n**Not tested: a code entered in the app on production.** The rollout session checked a live code directly through Chargebee: checkout showed $0.00, and the code stayed unused. Nobody has signed in to the app on production and entered a code, because that means creating a production account, which you haven't approved. I also haven't clicked through the gear → Get more credits → Enter your code path myself. I took it from the app's source and the staging screenshots. The first subscriber to use a code will be the real test. The daily check will show whether it worked.\n\n**Cleanup, each waiting for your yes:**\n- **In SendGrid:** the test list and test campaign from the subscriber email check, an old test segment, the GlockApps test campaigns, and the empty batch 5 segments. Separately, the one-person test contact k@obico.io holds the fake code JP1-TEST-ONLY, which is harmless.\n- **On staging:** a test account and an unused test code from the loyalty session's walkthrough.\n- **The scheduled task `jusprin2-feedback-replies`,** which I listed earlier for deletion.\n\n**Not done: counting JusPrin 2 sign-ups for each of the four batch 5 groups.** This is the other half of judging batch 5. Opens and clicks are already saved.\n\n**Checked and fine:** the loyalty plan's server code (tsd-enterprise commit `65dd4972f0`) is on both `master` and `release`, so nothing is stranded on a side branch.\n\nShould I delete the 4,110 batch 5 contacts from SendGrid now, or wait?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1142,"cache_read_input_tokens":347335,"output_tokens":896,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1142,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":896,"cache_read_input_tokens":347335,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1142,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1142},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"844d75cb-4e95-4a64-9ac1-fb0331788b88","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChQYu2CttNFSd5EK4cmWi","requestRef":"63b8b0c5-fee2-4239-b46c-396bc91fb24b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"c8e6e692-9dc7-413d-9e10-ad4855c08876","timestamp":"2026-